{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LangGraph构建多智能体工作流\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LangGraph构建多智能体工作流\" dir=\"auto\">LangGraph构建多智能体工作流</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明如何使用LangGraph构建多智能体工作流，包括状态设计、节点实现、条件路由、并行执行等高级特性。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangGraph多智能体工作流设计</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangGraph通过状态图（StateGraph）实现多Agent协作，其核心优势在于精细的控制流和状态管理。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>多Agent工作流架构：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">LangGraph多Agent工作流\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                 Supervisor（调度Agent）            │\n│              任务分解 │ 结果汇总 │ 质量控制          │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                   │\n│   ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐  │\n│   │ Agent A  │    │ Agent B  │    │ Agent C  │  │\n│   │(研究员)  │    │(分析师)  │    │(作家)    │  │\n│   └────┬─────┘    └────┬─────┘    └────┬─────┘  │\n│        │               │               │         │\n│        └───────────────┼───────────────┘         │\n│                        ▼                         │\n│                ┌──────────────┐                  │\n│                │  共享State   │                  │\n│                │  (Blackboard)│                  │\n│                └──────────────┘                  │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>完整代码示例：AI研究团队协作系统</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> TypedDict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Annotated<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Literal\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> END\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>checkpoint<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> MemorySaver\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> operator <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> add\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 1. 定义共享状态 ==========</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ResearchState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>TypedDict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"所有Agent共享的状态\"\"\"</span>\n    topic<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>                    <span class=\"token comment\"># 研究主题</span>\n    search_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 搜索结果（累加字段）</span>\n    analysis<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>                 <span class=\"token comment\"># 分析结果</span>\n    report<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>                   <span class=\"token comment\"># 最终报告</span>\n    quality_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span>          <span class=\"token comment\"># 质量评分</span>\n    iteration<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span>                <span class=\"token comment\"># 迭代次数</span>\n    next_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>                <span class=\"token comment\"># 下一步决策</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 2. 定义Agent节点 ==========</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">research_agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"研究Agent：负责信息收集\"\"\"</span>\n    topic <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"topic\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 模拟搜索（实际调用搜索API）</span>\n    results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"关于</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>topic<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">的最新进展1...\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"关于</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>topic<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">的技术突破2...\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"关于</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>topic<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">的应用案例3...\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"search_results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 累加到现有结果</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"iteration\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"iteration\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">analysis_agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"分析Agent：负责深度分析\"\"\"</span>\n    results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"search_results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 模拟分析</span>\n    analysis <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"基于</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>results<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">条搜索结果的分析：\\n\"</span></span>\n    analysis <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"1. 技术趋势分析...\\n2. 市场影响评估...\\n3. 未来发展方向...\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> analysis<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">writing_agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"写作Agent：负责生成报告\"\"\"</span>\n    analysis <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    report <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"# 研究报告\\n\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>analysis<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n## 结论\\n基于以上分析...\"</span></span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> report<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">quality_check_agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"质量检查Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    report <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 模拟质量评分</span>\n    score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.85</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>report<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">500</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.6</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"quality_score\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> score<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"next_step\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"pass\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"revise\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">revision_agent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"修订Agent：改进报告质量\"\"\"</span>\n    report <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    improved <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> report <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n## 补充分析\\n基于进一步研究...\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> improved<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 3. 条件路由函数 ==========</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">route_by_quality</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Literal<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"pass\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"revise\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据质量评分决定路由\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"next_step\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"pass\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">should_continue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Literal<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"continue\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"end\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查是否需要继续迭代\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"iteration\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"end\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"continue\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 4. 构建工作流图 ==========</span>\nworkflow <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StateGraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 添加节点</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> research_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> analysis_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"writing\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> writing_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> quality_check_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"revision\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> revision_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 设置入口</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_entry_point<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 添加边</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"writing\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"writing\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 条件边：质量检查后的路由</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_conditional_edges<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    route_by_quality<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"pass\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> END<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"revise\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"revision\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"revision\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"quality_check\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== 5. 编译并运行 ==========</span>\napp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> workflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">compile</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>checkpointer<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>MemorySaver<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 执行</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> app<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"topic\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AI Agent技术发展趋势\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search_results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"iteration\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"configurable\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"thread_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research_001\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"最终报告:\\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'report'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"质量评分: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'quality_score'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangGraph多Agent的高级特性：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>并行执行</strong>：同一超步骤内的节点自动并行</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 并行执行多个研究Agent</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_web\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> web_research_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_paper\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> paper_research_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_news\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> news_research_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 从同一节点出发的三条边会并行执行</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"start\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research_web\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"start\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research_paper\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"start\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research_news\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 汇聚节点等待所有并行任务完成</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_edge<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_web\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research_paper\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research_news\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"synthesize\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Human-in-the-loop</strong>：人工审批节点</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>types <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> interrupt\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">human_approval_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ResearchState<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"人工审批节点\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 中断执行，等待人工输入</span>\n    approval <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> interrupt<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"请审查以下报告并决定是否批准:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"human_decision\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> approval<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>子图嵌套</strong>：复杂流程模块化</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 将研究工作流封装为子图</span>\nresearch_subgraph <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> create_research_subgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nanalysis_subgraph <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> create_analysis_subgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 在主图中使用子图</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_phase\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> research_subgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nworkflow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_node<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analysis_phase\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> analysis_subgraph<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：LangGraph的状态合并机制是如何工作的？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：每个节点返回的是一个状态\"片段\"（Partial State），LangGraph会自动合并到全局状态中。对于列表类型字段，可以使用<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">Annotated</code>+<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">add</code>实现累加而非覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：LangGraph多Agent工作流的性能优化策略？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：并行化独立节点；使用异步节点减少IO等待；Checkpoint选择性保存（只保存必要状态）；子图编译缓存；节点结果缓存避免重复计算。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：LangGraph的节点是真正的独立进程或线程。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：LangGraph节点是Python函数，默认在同一进程中运行。并行执行通过LangGraph的运行时调度实现，不是真正的多进程。对于CPU密集型任务，需要在节点内部自行实现并行。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}